                    "content": "None of the major car rental companies in Los Angeles (SunSet Rent-A-Car, Speedy Rentals, LAX Car Rental) currently list electric cars among their available types\u2014they offer sedans, SUVs, convertibles, and trucks.\n\nHowever, here are the top-rated companies and their weekly prices (for a standard car):\n\n1. SunSet Rent-A-Car\n   - Rating: 4.5 (Great service, friendly staff, convenient location)\n   - Price per day: $45.00\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $315.00\n\n2. Speedy Rentals\n   - Rating: 4.5 (Great service, friendly staff, easy to drive cars)\n   - Price per day: $48.00\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $336.00\n\n3. LAX Car Rental\n   - Rating: 4.1 (Convenient pick-up at LAX, good value)\n   - Price per day: $39.99\n   - Weekly price (7 days): $279.93\n\nThe highest-rated companies are SunSet Rent-A-Car and Speedy Rentals (both 4.5 stars). SunSet Rent-A-Car is slightly cheaper for a week ($315.00).\n\nIf you specifically need an electric car, let me know and I can help you look for specialty or green car rental agencies in Los Angeles!"
